## Negative findings - why this file is `.md.excluded`

As of 2026-10-05, no verified public model, benchmark, or pricing exists for `mai-experimental-test`:

- `mai-experimental-test` does not resolve to any published Microsoft MAI model. The publicly documented MAI line is MAI-Thinking-1, MAI-Code-1-Flash, MAI-Image-2.5/2.6, MAI-Voice-2, MAI-Transcribe-1.5/2 — none is listed or aliased as "mai-experimental-test".
- No artificial-analysis row, Vals AI entry, or OpenRouter/ModelRouter `mai-experimental-test` ID exists.
- The folder's metadata is a scaffold placeholder ("Mai Experimental Test model evaluation entry.", 128K generic spec) with no provider, ID, or pricing.
- Every verifiable MAI finding therefore cannot be attributed to this exact slug; writing scores would be invention.

If Microsoft later publishes a model matching this slug, re-research and file a real scored report.
